<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//DITA Bootstrap//DTD DITA Bootstrap Topic//EN" "bootstrap-topic.dtd">
<topic id="list-group">
  <title>List Group</title>
  <shortdesc>List groups are a flexible and powerful component for displaying a series of content. Modify and extend
    them to support just about any content within.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>List Group</indexterm>
        <indexterm>CSS
          <indexterm><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></indexterm>
        </indexterm>
        <indexterm><xmlelement>ul</xmlelement></indexterm>
        <indexterm><xmlelement>ol</xmlelement></indexterm>
        <indexterm><xmlatt>compact</xmlatt></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body outputclass="language-markup">
    <section>
      <title>Basic example</title>
      <p>The most basic list group is an unordered list with list items and the proper classes. Build upon it with the
        options that follow, or with your own CSS as needed.</p>
    </section>
    <fig>
      <title>List Group</title>
      <image href="src/list-group-1.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>
    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/specialization/list-group/basic-example.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/html/list-group/basic-example.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>
    <section>
      <title>Compacted list group</title>
      <p>Add <xmlatt>compact="yes"</xmlatt> to reduce the padding of list items</p>
    </section>
    <fig>
      <title>Compacted list group</title>
      <image href="src/list-group-2.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>
    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/specialization/list-group/compacted-list-group.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/html/list-group/compacted-list-group.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>
    <section>
      <title>Expanded list group</title>
      <p>Add <xmlatt>compact="no"</xmlatt> to increase the padding of list items</p>
    </section>
    <fig>
      <title>Expanded list group</title>
      <image href="src/list-group-3.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>
    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/specialization/list-group/expanded-list-group.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/html/list-group/expanded-list-group.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>
    <section>
      <title>Flush</title>
      <p>Add a <xmlatt>flush="yes"</xmlatt> to remove some borders and
        rounded corners to render list group items edge-to-edge in a parent container (e.g., cards).</p>
    </section>
    <fig>
      <title>Flush List Group</title>
      <image href="src/list-group-4.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>
    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/specialization/list-group/flush.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/html/list-group/flush.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>
  </body>
</topic>
